<section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-28 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-sm font-semibold mb-4 border border-blue-200">El modelo SaaS definitivo[cite: 1]</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-6">
        Potencia tu negocio gastronómico con <span class="text-blue-600">Ollintem</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Sistemas punto de venta en la nube diseñados para agilizar el mostrador de tu Pizzería o Restaurante. Toma el control total de tus ventas, comandas e inventario.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#planes" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/30">
          Ver Planes
        </a>
        <a href="#sistemas" class="bg-white text-gray-800 border border-gray-300 px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all shadow-sm">
          Explorar Sistemas
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Fondo decorativo (estilo moderno) -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-full overflow-hidden -z-10">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-400 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-20"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-40 -left-40 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-20"></div>
  </div>
</section>